.SH BUGS
Report bugs at https://github.com/GhostofGoes/WOPR/issues.
Run wopr with WOPR_DEBUG=1 and attach the debug log it names when it exits, with
the seed if you used one.
The full\-screen interface has not yet been tried with a screen reader.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B wopr
Dial in and log on.
.TP
.B "wopr chess \-i"
Play chess with no typewriter pacing.
.TP
.B "wopr \-\-games"
List the games.
.TP
.B "wopr \-m 2"
Replay the film from scene 2.
.TP
.B "wopr \-m joshua \-o"
Replay just the joshua scene.
.TP
.B "WOPR_THEME=green wopr \-r"
Use the green theme, with no blinking.
